  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoons light corn syrup",
    "1 loaf French bread, cut into 1-inch slices",
    "8 eggs",
    "2 cups prepared eggnog"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TUBf39kJqKtbVHezuD4Iuw0L4q0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-217954-overnight-eggnog-french-toast-step-01-f226c294048841dba2d9255ec6f5fd8e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217954/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat brown sugar, butter, and corn syrup in a small saucepan over medium heat. Cook and stir until mixture begins to boil; remove the mixture from heat, and pour into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9hfzj6OGmvqcRpGHSw6vM5ILIeI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-217954-overnight-eggnog-french-toast-step-02-B-f5155f032356492499b8f0ab9b804e5d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217954/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bread slices atop brown sugar mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_R4HbAdJa0i8bRtTRu_xdcA3we4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-217954-overnight-eggnog-french-toast-step-03-5b32474f31bd4259ba197647e16bb182.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217954/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs and eggnog together in a large bowl; pour over bread slices. Cover the baking dish with aluminum foil, and refrigerate 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r8Ssq6HoHmJxgijDqAADJtZEPaA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-217954-overnight-eggnog-french-toast-step-04-A-1039b4daaefd40c0a27f52342cc33130.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217954/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Remove the baking dish from the refrigerator.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lV-n960NWO3LLTSQX2TyYBurMf8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-217954-overnight-eggnog-french-toast-step-05-c464ed90a0d44456a7b82eeda15082f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217954/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven, covered, until custard has set, about 35 to 40 minutes. Increase heat to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C); remove the aluminum foil, and continue baking until the the top is golden brown, about 5 minutes more.",
